1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
The fall of the Romanovs, explained like you are five.

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:06,040
Step one, 1894, Nicholas II becomes Tsar of Russia.

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,280
He inherits the largest empire on earth,

4
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:10,240
one sixth of all the land in the world,

5
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,920
130 million people, and a personal fortune

6
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,520
worth $300 billion in today's money.

7
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:18,640
Palaces, art, gold, jewels, land,

8
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,080
more wealth than any family in human history.

9
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,560
Nicholas and his wife, Alexandra,

10
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,080
live in a world completely sealed from reality.

11
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:28,040
Balls, palaces, private trains, private yachts,

12
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:31,360
five children, their youngest son, Alexei, has hemophilia.

13
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,000
A single cut can kill him.

14
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,560
Alexandra becomes obsessed with finding a cure

15
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,800
and falls under the influence

16
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,040
of a Siberian mystic named Rasputin,

17
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,240
who somehow stops Alexei's bleeding when nobody else can.

18
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:44,440
The royal family trusts him completely.

19
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,840
The Russian aristocracy is horrified.

20
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,480
Outside the palace walls, Russia is starving.

21
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:52,040
Nicholas does not notice or does not care,

22
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:54,160
both explanations and the same way.

23
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,200
Step two, 1905, Russia loses a war against Japan.

24
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,720
The humiliation triggers a revolution.

25
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,480
Workers march on the winter palace.

26
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:04,720
The army fires on them, hundreds dead.

27
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:08,040
Nicholas survives, promises reforms, delivers almost none.

28
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:12,040
1914, World War I, Russia mobilizes 15 million men,

29
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,120
sends them into battle without enough rifles.

30
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:16,160
Soldiers order to pick up weapons from the dead.

31
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:18,640
Two million Russian soldiers die in the first year.

32
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,720
Nicholas takes personal command of the army,

33
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:23,200
which means every defeat is now personally his.

34
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:25,080
At home, Alexandra runs the government,

35
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:27,640
guided by Rasputin, dismissing competent ministers,

36
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,320
appointing mystics and frauds.

37
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:32,240
The aristocracy murders Rasputin in 1916,

38
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:35,000
poisons him, shoots him, throws him in a frozen river.

39
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,160
He dies from drowning.

40
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:37,520
It does not save the Romanovs.

41
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:38,680
It is too late for that.

42
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:41,520
Step three, February 1917, Petrograd.

43
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,680
The workers go on strike.

44
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:45,200
The soldiers sent to shoot them, join the strike instead.

45
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,520
Nicholas is on his train.

46
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:48,000
His generals tell him it is over.

47
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,360
He abdicates on a train.

48
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:51,120
300 years of Romanov rule,

49
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:53,080
ended with a signature in a railway carriage.

50
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,800
The provisional government puts the family

51
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,920
under house arrest.

52
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,840
They are moved east, further east,

53
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:00,120
as the Bolsheviks take power in October,

54
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,760
further east to Yekaterinburg in the Ural Mountains

55
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,680
to a merchant's house requisitioned by the local Soviet.

56
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:08,400
The family calls it the House of Special Purpose.

57
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,720
They are allowed to walk in the garden once a day.

58
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:11,920
Nicholas chops wood.

59
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,120
The children put on plays.

60
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,640
Alexandra reads the Bible.

61
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:17,120
They have been in captivity for 16 months.

62
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,320
They still believe they will be rescued.

63
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:22,200
Step four, July 1918.

64
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,400
The White Army is advancing on Yekaterinburg.

65
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,640
Moscow sends a telegram.

66
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:28,600
The Romanovs cannot be allowed to fall into White Army hands.

67
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:31,440
At midnight on July 16th, the family is woken.

68
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,280
Told to dress.

69
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,560
They are going somewhere safer.

70
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,760
They go to the basement.

71
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:37,160
Nicholas, Alexandra, their five children,

72
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:39,440
the family doctor, three servants, the cook,

73
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,720
11 people total.

74
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,360
They are told to wait for transport.

75
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,200
They wait.

76
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,440
Then the guards file in.

77
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:46,400
Yakov Yurovsky reads the death sentence.

78
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,760
Nicholas says, what?

79
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:48,640
The shooting starts.

80
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,720
It is over in seconds.

81
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:50,800
Except it is not over.

82
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,080
The daughters are still alive.

83
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:54,000
The bullets are deflecting off their bodies

84
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,440
because Alexandra had sewn the family jewels

85
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:58,040
into the lining of their corsets.

86
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:01,120
Diamonds, rubies, pearls, millions of dollars of gemstones

87
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:04,080
sewn in as insurance in case they needed money to escape.

88
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,560
The jewels deflect the bullets.

89
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,600
The guards use bayonets, more bullets.

90
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:10,040
It takes 11 minutes to kill 11 people.

91
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,600
The bodies are driven to a forest, doused in acid,

92
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,000
burned, buried in secret.

93
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:16,360
For 70 years, the Soviet government denies

94
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,520
knowing where they are.

95
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:20,800
The bones are found in 1979 by an amateur historian

96
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,240
following old documents.

97
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,920
The Soviet government buries the discovery

98
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,360
for another 12 years.

99
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:29,200
In 1998, the Romanovs are finally given a state funeral.

100
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,560
80 years after the basement,

101
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,400
the jewels that were supposed to save them

102
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,560
were found with the bones,

103
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,880
still sewn into the rotted fabric of their clothes.

104
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:38,320
And that's just one story inside Paladin.

105
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,880
It's like Duolingo, but for history lovers.

106
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:43,720
Download it now and become the most intelligent person

107
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:44,560
in the room.

